https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/20df4054a3fad9d7da357dcef2ecf8b6?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1612180125, "last_modified": 1758858391, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "chargeAha", "last_touched": 1790519551, "title": "各位大佬，请问怎么才能用上 Claude？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1244970", "created": 1790468014, "deleted": 0, "content": "听大家对 Claude 评价如此高？请问走哪里可以用上 Claude 呀？封号真的很夸张吗？\r\n\r\n目前是自己的节点，走的搬瓦工的机器。ios 美区可以订阅，请问各位大佬，我这种条件能不能比较愉快、安全使用 Claude ？或者能不能跟其他人拼车", "content_rendered": "<p>听大家对 Claude 评价如此高？请问走哪里可以用上 Claude 呀？封号真的很夸张吗？</p>\n<p>目前是自己的节点，走的搬瓦工的机器。ios 美区可以订阅，请问各位大佬，我这种条件能不能比较愉快、安全使用 Claude ？或者能不能跟其他人拼车</p>\n", "last_modified": 1790468014, "replies": 35, "id": 1244970}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/3b5d/ca50/819_large.png?m=1633251402", "name": "watch", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/3b5d/ca50/819_normal.png?m=1633251402", "title": " WATCH", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/watch", "topics": 1516, "footer": "", "header": "<a href=\"/go/apple\">Apple</a> 公司设计的智能手表产品", "title_alternative": " WATCH", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/3b5d/ca50/819_mini.png?m=1633251402", "stars": 593, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 819, "parent_node_name": "apple"}, "member": {"id": 232650, "username": "qwertyyb", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/qwertyyb", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d252/312c/232650_mini.png?m=1602564756", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d252/312c/232650_normal.png?m=1602564756", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d252/312c/232650_large.png?m=1602564756", "created": 1495777598, "last_modified": 1602564756, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "kkwa56188", "last_touched": 1790539421, "title": "新款 Apple Watch 的设计太离谱了吧", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1245062", "created": 1790511580, "deleted": 0, "content": "欲购入 AW ，感受老去的时光，本眼红国行有国补，纠结于无快充，但算了笔账，发现港版相比国行贵 100 多感觉可以接受，于是下定前去体验店摸了一把，非常失望。\r\n\r\nS12 的大圆角宽边框是认真的吗？\r\n一天一充但是搭配官方表带却没有一个取戴方便的？", "content_rendered": "<p>欲购入 AW ，感受老去的时光，本眼红国行有国补，纠结于无快充，但算了笔账，发现港版相比国行贵 100 多感觉可以接受，于是下定前去体验店摸了一把，非常失望。</p>\n<p>S12 的大圆角宽边框是认真的吗？\n一天一充但是搭配官方表带却没有一个取戴方便的？</p>\n", "last_modified": 1790512031, "replies": 24, "id": 1245062}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/df0a/ab05/1148_large.png?m=1751736790", "name": "claude", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/df0a/ab05/1148_normal.png?m=1751736790", "title": "Claude", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/claude", "topics": 945, "footer": "", "header": "", "title_alternative": "Claude", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/df0a/ab05/1148_mini.png?m=1751736790", "stars": 722, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 1148, "parent_node_name": "geek"}, "member": {"id": 158867, "username": "RealLiuSha", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/RealLiuSha", "website": "https://liusha.net", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "", "location": "ShenZhen", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6bb5/661d/158867_mini.png?m=1670225885", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6bb5/661d/158867_normal.png?m=1670225885", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6bb5/661d/158867_large.png?m=1670225885", "created": 1455519625, "last_modified": 1670225885, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "dm87497", "last_touched": 1790501335, "title": "Claude 这波操作给我整不会了", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1244968", "created": 1790467552, "deleted": 0, "content": "20x 被封了好几个，之前卡开的都退钱了，但是不解封，申诉也没用\r\n\r\n最近 opus 不是吹的飞起，又大着胆子开了个 20x ，刚特么开了账号就被秒封。钱没退，我都准备认赔了(申诉被拒)。\r\n\r\n结果昨天突然收到邮件，说账号恢复了。现在又能正常用，已经爽蹬起来了。\r\n\r\nA 畜也真就靠着模型牛逼，为所欲为。\r\n\r\n ![]( https://i.imgur.com/EBzOFZ7.png) \r\n \r\n  ![]( https://i.imgur.com/VhDMZxR.png)", "content_rendered": "<p>20x 被封了好几个，之前卡开的都退钱了，但是不解封，申诉也没用</p>\n<p>最近 opus 不是吹的飞起，又大着胆子开了个 20x ，刚特么开了账号就被秒封。钱没退，我都准备认赔了(申诉被拒)。</p>\n<p>结果昨天突然收到邮件，说账号恢复了。现在又能正常用，已经爽蹬起来了。</p>\n<p>A 畜也真就靠着模型牛逼，为所欲为。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EBzOFZ7.png\"/> </p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VhDMZxR.png\"/></p>\n", "last_modified": 1790467552, "replies": 23, "id": 1244968}]